hdmiosd (0.2.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Hide the pointer while dragging margin sliders.
  * Flush sidebar against the content pane (no inter-pane gap); keep
    padding inside each pane.
  * F11/F12 cycle previous/next theme with a desktop notification.
  * Pin the pointer to the margin slider thumb on grab and while
    adjusting; disable margin handlers while dragging the OSD window.
  * Margins are relative to the current monitor client area (not the
    virtual desktop); window drag updates nearest-edge margins live
    and highlights the last-updated control.
  * Margin sliders grab at the current value (no jump-off-slider on
    first click); drag the OSD from any blank area.
  * Prefer DejaVu/FreeSans bold for an OSD-like face instead of UI Sans.
  * Map theme roles to distinct palette classes and enforce contrast so
    labels stay readable on accent fills.
  * Semantic typography roles (title/button/label/value/enum/menu);
    richer VS Code style-class mapping; sized Theme button; colored
    theme picker popup.

 -- Lenik (谢继雷) <lenik@bodz.net>  Fri, 30 Oct 2026 16:53:18 +0800

hdmiosd (0.2.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Embed hdmiosd.png in assets.zip; set I2C timeouts so probe cannot
    hang the UI thread.
  * Prefer PNG app icon; rebuild assets when files change; detach
    cancelled worker threads.
  * Drop wxFRAME_TOOL_WINDOW so the OSD actually maps; Raise on show;
    clamp placement on-screen.
  * Log enumeration/probe/VCP steps under -v/-vvv (including --list).
  * Fix 1×1 invisible window: SetTransparent/size only after Show;
    defer DDC scan until the shell UI has mapped.
  * Margin drag uses screen Δx only; never WarpPointer / UIActionSimulator.
  * Skip local MinGW packaging when mingw bas-cpp/bas-ui are unavailable.

 -- Lenik (谢继雷) <lenik@bodz.net>  Fri, 30 Oct 2026 15:47:21 +0800

hdmiosd (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Refactor to C++ / wxWidgets with canvas OSD and embedded assets.
  * Split Device OSD vs App OSD; persist settings.ini under
    ~/.config/hdmiosd/.
  * Embed Tabler icons via assets.zip + bas-cpp ZipVolume Assets.
  * Treat VCP 0x0C as discrete white-point modes (5k/6.5k/…), not a
    linear Kelvin slider.
  * Borderless OSD centered on the pointer's display; App OSD under
    Device OSD; single Refresh for displays and controls.
  * Discrete controls use grayable < > arrows; white Tabler icons with
    vertical icon/label alignment; SVG app icon.
  * Theme switcher (minor / vibe / country, light then dark) via
    minor-themes JSON palettes.
  * Show the OSD immediately; discover displays and read VCP controls
    asynchronously with progressive UI updates.
  * Add gettext catalogs for L1 locales (ar, de, es_MX, fr, it, ja, ko,
    zh_CN).

 -- Lenik (谢继雷) <lenik@bodz.net>  Fri, 30 Oct 2026 15:35:00 +0800

hdmiosd (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * On-screen DDC/CI controller for HDMI/DP displays.
  * Implement direct DDC/CI over Linux I2C (no ddcutil).
  * Discover displays via DRM connectors and /dev/i2c-*; -d resolves
    related buses.
  * GTK3 OSD UI with feature tabs, opacity/geometry/placement, keyboard
    shortcuts.
  * Build against gtk+-3.0; refresh man page, README, and bash
    completion.
  * Canvas OSD UI with highlighted active control, Tab cycling, and
    aligned presets.
  * Per-control undo history and reset-to-baseline; refresh
    displays/controls.
  * Show color temperature as Kelvin; enable RGB gain via User preset;
    hide empty Audio.

